    {
      "id": "28:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你倒在床上，伸展着僵硬的腿脚。查理给录像倒了带，拿了磁带机的遥控器，在你身边躺下。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:9645:9688"
    },
    {
      "id": "28:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“舒服了？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:9688:9696"
    },
    {
      "id": "28:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“嗯。”你说。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:9696:9705"
    },
    {
      "id": "28:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“好，不管是什么电影，开始啦。”查理笑着按下了播放键。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:9705:9734"
    },
    {
